+ * Return: SWAP_PMD_CACHE_EMPTY if no slot in the PMD range has a cached folio,
+ * SWAP_PMD_CACHE_HUGE if one PMD-sized folio covers the range, or
+ * SWAP_PMD_CACHE_SPLIT if the range needs per-page handling.
